Historical verification assets
==============================

The public-tensile-20260906 directory contains two figures and a JSON result
summary accompanying the repository's dated public tensile case record:

https://github.com/koocmitwho/experiment-to-cpfe-pipeline/blob/v0.2.1/docs/verification/2026-09-06-public-tensile-surrogate.md

These assets remain in the source distribution as companion case materials.
The dated narrative is maintained in the repository. Its model, specimen splits,
execution date and subsequent notes supply the context for the figures and values.

The designated tensile assets use CC-BY-4.0. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md at the
distribution root for source authors, the source DOI, attribution and processing
details. The JSON summary and figures retain their original bytes.
